                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last week, I spoke with constituents like Carol from Mountain View about the government shutdown. Carol shared her frustration over false claims from congressional Republicans that the Affordable Care Act tax credits fund health care for undocumented immigrants. Carol\u2019s right: they don\u2019t, and never have. These tax credits do help 24,000 of our local citizens\u2013and 22 million nationally\u2013 cut their health premiums in half, though\u2026and the rest of us save more by keeping healthier people in the insurance pool.",
