                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Join us for a town hall meeting this Thursday, October 30, at Foothill College\u2019s Smithwick Theater in Los Altos. I look forward to answering your questions on the steps ahead through this government shutdown, protecting health care, lowering the cost of housing, and more\u2014RSVP if you can make it! \nhttps://t.co/DDlXi9LO2p",
