                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "With the government shutdown, uncertainty surrounding CalFresh, and worries about health care costs, I\u2019m hosting a town hall to discuss what comes next.\n\nJoin me tomorrow, Thursday, October 30, at Foothill College\u2019s Smithwick Theater in Los Altos Hills. If you can make it, RSVP here \u2b07\ufe0f\u2b07\ufe0f\u2b07\ufe0f\n\nhttps://t.co/DDlXi9MlRX",
