                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For several weeks, I\u2019ve been on the phone with a couple of dozen Republicans working toward an agreement. On Monday, we introduced a bill to keep health care affordable for tens of millions of Americans \u2014 and we identified a responsible way to pay for it. But before we could announce the bill's filing, the Senate kicked the can down the road yet again.",
